{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265Ns9MdQMFO1793617094.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產新界東豪宅副區域營業董事梁廣成表示，樓市氣氛持續正面，帶動買家入市信心，大埔寶馬山最新錄9座中層D室，單位實用面積750平方呎，3房連套房間隔，日前議價後以790萬元易手，實用平均呎價約10,533元。</p><p> </p><p>據了解，新買家為外區家庭客，見屋苑環境舒適，加上單位價錢合理，間隔合用，即購入單位自住。據了解，據了解，原業主於2011年以490萬元購入單位，持貨約15年，是次轉手賬面上獲利300萬元或61.2%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:05:46.333002+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:31.586677+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:58:37.720804+00:00","content_hash":"31f9fd6786b679aed924f6ea83744da5a5e90fb7afde925315c9a605e4cf2211","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}